{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"整概形"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“整概形”"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>称满足如下等价条件的"},{"Local":{"url":"概形","text":"概形"}},{"Plain":" $X$ 为整概形:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对任意 Zariski 开集 $U\\subset X$, $\\Gamma(\\mathcal O_X,U)$ 为整环;</li>\n<li>$X$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"既约概形","text":"既约概形"}},{"Plain":", 且 $X$ 的底层拓扑空间不可约.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>整概形 $X$ 有"},{"Local":{"url":"一般点","text":"一般点"}},{"Plain":" (generic point) $\\eta$, 且茎 $\\mathcal O_{X,\\eta}$ 是域, 称为 $X$ 的有理函数域.</p>\n"}]}}